  "description": "The Lost Mary BM6000 Prefilled Kit designed for extended enjoyment and endless flexibility, this kit offers up to 6000 puffs thanks to its innovative use of a prefilled 2ml pod that can be instantly refreshed with the attached 10ml refill container. This V2 edition of the Lost Mary BM6000 lets you change your flavours for any in the Lost Mary BM6000 collection at any time, whether that’s because your original pod+refill’s e-liquid is spent, or you just want to try something new! Lost Mary’s Mesh coil technology enhances the flavour and vapour production, giving you a rich and consistent vape. The OLED display provides easy access to battery status, while the visible e-liquid level keeps you informed. With a Nicotine Salt strength of 20mg, the Summer Grape flavour delivers a smooth throat hit and rapid nicotine satisfaction, making it a versatile and user-friendly option for adult vapers. The kit is powered by a 1000mAh rechargeable battery, which can be charged quickly via USB Type-C (cable sold separately), you can keep track of the charging status with a simple glance at the OLED display screen on the device. How to Use Your Lost Mary BM6000 Prefilled Vape kit: Get your Lost Mary BM6000 ready for use with these easy steps: 1. Remove the device and e-liquid refill bottle from the packaging. 2. Remove safety stickers attached to the components. 3. Take off the lid on the refill bottle. (Do not remove the rubber cover) 4. Remove the plug where the refill container meets the pod. 5. Insert the bottle upwards and into the side of the device until flush. 6. Turn the device upside down to fill the 2ml tank chamber. 7. Leave to stand for several minutes before vaping to allow the coil to saturate with e-liquid. To Detach the 2ml Pod and 10ml E-liquid Refill Container: 1. Press the release catch at the base of the battery 2. Slide out the E-liquid Refill Container 3. Slide out the Pod Shop BM6000 Refill Pods",
